# Commerce

Read @docs/ECOMMERCE.md and @docs/RFQ.md.

- One price-resolution module on the server. Client only previews.
- Reject retail checkout if a line is `request_quote` only.
- Checkout: Ghana address; phone required; zones from DB.
- Other Region / Nationwide Request: do not invent a shipping fee.
- Paystack init on the server after order insert. Mark paid only after webhook + verify. MoMo is async.
- Quote statuses: draft → submitted → under_review → priced → sent → accepted → payment_pending → paid → order_created. Also declined, expired, cancelled, revised.
- Accepted quotes create orders that **snapshot quote prices**, not live tiers.
- Revisions clone; do not overwrite a sent quote in place.
- Decrement inventory after paid or confirmed terms (bank / PO / invoice).
